# readme_runnable_test.go's compile/run gates write these at the module
# root (os.MkdirTemp(".", ...)) so `go run`/`go build` resolve
# github.com/azex-ai/ledger and go.work normally; each test removes its own
# on success, but a killed process (SIGKILL, a CI timeout) leaves one
# behind.
readmecheck-*/
readmecompile-*/

# Scratch space for measurement reports and local tool state (bench output,
# gh device id). Never committed -- some of it is credential-adjacent.
.local/
